      Full guide with OData endpoint examples, attestation patterns, and ABAP/Python hybrid transform skeleton: <a href="https://github.com/ulcspec/ULC/blob/main/mappings/pim/sap.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener external"><code>github.com/ulcspec/ULC/blob/main/mappings/pim/sap.md</code></a>
    </p>
    </div>
  </SpecDocsLayout>
